# Import paths

No `./` or `../` in TypeScript imports or re-exports.

| Scope | Pattern |
| ----- | ------- |
| Cross-package | `@ndb/<package>` |
| Within-package | `@<short-name>/<path-from-src>` — e.g. `@core/`, `@api/`, `@bootstrap/` |
| API test helpers | `@tests/api/<path>` |

New packages: add within-package alias to root `tsconfig.json` `paths` only; child tsconfigs `extends` root. Cross-package imports use workspace `dependencies` and `package.json` `exports`, not tsconfig paths.

## No inline import type queries

Import types at the top — not `import("module").Type` in type positions. For Bun partial mocks, use a top-level namespace import and `importOriginal`.
